  "attack": {
    "name": "Guard Tactics: Sword and Shield",
    "description": "<span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Normal Attack</span>\nPerforms up to 3 consecutive sword strikes.\n\n<span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Charged Attack</span>\nConsumes a certain amount of Stamina to leap forward and slam the ground, dealing Physical DMG to nearby opponents.\nWhen Valeriy has at least 40 <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\"><button data-link=\"11370003\">Impact Momentum</button></span>, he will consume all <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Impact Momentum</span> to instead perform the special Charged Attack <span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\"><button data-link=\"11370001\">Direct-Fire Mortar: Point-Blank Bombardment</button></span>.\n\n<span style=\"color: #FFD780FF;\">Plunging Attack</span>\nPlunges from mid-air to strike the ground below, damaging opponents along the path and dealing AoE DMG upon impact.<button data-link=\"11370002\"></button>",
